1
00:03:04,635 --> 00:03:05,614
Mister !

2
00:03:09,774 --> 00:03:10,752
Mister !

3
00:03:35,165 --> 00:03:38,204
Here 's your bread . I 'll get your cupcakes .

4
00:03:41,872 --> 00:03:45,912
Biring , is this all for twenty pesos ?

5
00:03:46,578 --> 00:03:47,989
Nothing I can do about it .

6
00:03:48,079 --> 00:03:50,752
- All costs went up . - Here 's your cupcake .

7
00:03:52,050 --> 00:03:53,027
Is that yours ?

8
00:03:53,751 --> 00:03:55,730
Someone left it in the bus .

9
00:04:01,292 --> 00:04:03,100
The Chinese call this " Bagua " .

10
00:04:03,961 --> 00:04:05,235
It keeps away bad luck .

11
00:04:05,562 --> 00:04:06,802
We have one right there .

12
00:04:07,264 --> 00:04:08,710
That 's why I think we 're lucky .

13
00:04:09,967 --> 00:04:11,538
But this one 's an antique .

14
00:04:11,836 --> 00:04:13,281
With an unusual mirror .

15
00:04:16,440 --> 00:04:20,582
It deflects bad spirits so they can 't harm us .

16
00:04:20,944 --> 00:04:24,050
But this one , you shouldn 't hang indoors .

17
00:04:24,249 --> 00:04:27,230
- Instead ... - Outdoors . I know .

18
00:04:27,418 --> 00:04:30,262
I have a book on " Feng Shui " at home .

19
00:04:30,387 --> 00:04:33,596
That 's supposed to give you more luck , because you didn 't buy it .

20
00:04:34,391 --> 00:04:37,235
I hope so . I really need it .

21
00:04:38,463 --> 00:04:40,670
- What 's that ? - There 's an accident !

22
00:05:03,254 --> 00:05:04,528
Thank you , Nestor .

23
00:05:04,656 --> 00:05:06,499
- At 9 : 00 am tomorrow , as usual ? - Yes , Ma 'am .

24
00:05:06,557 --> 00:05:08,365
- Good night . - Good night .

25
00:05:10,495 --> 00:05:13,065
These kids are impossible !

26
00:05:26,009 --> 00:05:30,720
Daddy ... ! Daddy ... !

27
00:05:31,214 --> 00:05:33,821
- Daddy ... ! - What 's going on ?

28
00:05:35,052 --> 00:05:38,694
- There 's a gecko , Daddy ! - It 's a slink , not a gecko .

29
00:05:38,990 --> 00:05:40,298
It 's harmless .

30
00:05:40,824 --> 00:05:42,326
Where did you get that ?

31
00:05:42,659 --> 00:05:45,300
I got it from Billy for a pet .

32
00:05:45,862 --> 00:05:47,341
It might bite .

33
00:05:47,432 --> 00:05:48,466
Slinks are harmless .

34
00:05:48,533 --> 00:05:50,409
It eats only grasshoppers .

35
00:05:50,500 --> 00:05:54,812
I 'm scared of grasshoppers !

36
00:05:57,274 --> 00:05:58,810
Who 's that kid ?

37
00:05:59,911 --> 00:06:02,357
He 's our neighbor 's son . Your son 's playmate .

38
00:06:02,447 --> 00:06:04,653
Is dinner ready ? We 're hungry .

39
00:06:04,749 --> 00:06:05,853
It 's okay , baby .

40
00:06:05,949 --> 00:06:08,487
Why are there so many strange animals here ?

41
00:06:08,552 --> 00:06:11,055
They don 't have them at grandma 's !

42
00:06:11,355 --> 00:06:13,733
Get used to it , Ingrid .

43
00:06:13,824 --> 00:06:15,565
We live here now .

44
00:06:16,627 --> 00:06:19,266
Come on . Help me cook .

45
00:06:21,531 --> 00:06:23,533
Denton , take that outside ! Right now !

46
00:06:30,440 --> 00:06:32,317
- Not in my laundry ! - Yes , Mom !

47
00:06:34,846 --> 00:06:38,350
- Nestor ! - This fell from your things .

48
00:06:39,716 --> 00:06:42,220
Good thing it didn 't break .

49
00:06:42,387 --> 00:06:45,163
You know , I look handsome in that mirror .

50
00:06:45,523 --> 00:06:47,468
You can have this corned beef .

51
00:06:47,557 --> 00:06:51,233
- It 's my youngest 's favorite ! Thank you . - I wish you brought a dragon instead !

52
00:06:51,596 --> 00:06:53,973
- Tomorrow , Nestor . - Thank you .

53
00:07:04,742 --> 00:07:05,720
This tastes delicious !

54
00:07:06,209 --> 00:07:07,517
You 're a good cook .

55
00:07:07,778 --> 00:07:10,055
Yours is different . It 's full and tasty .

56
00:07:10,148 --> 00:07:11,923
Where 's your mother ?

57
00:07:12,483 --> 00:07:13,461
In Korea ...

58
00:07:13,550 --> 00:07:16,190
She 's a factory worker there for three years now .

59
00:07:16,687 --> 00:07:20,031
My father 's a cop but they 're separated .

60
00:07:20,425 --> 00:07:22,370
Who do you live with at home ?

61
00:07:22,927 --> 00:07:28,000
Aunt Ellen , my mother 's sister and Uncle Teodoro .

62
00:07:29,033 --> 00:07:30,410
They 're usually out .

63
00:07:30,567 --> 00:07:32,274
What does your aunt do ?

64
00:07:32,370 --> 00:07:34,144
They just started a new business .

65
00:07:34,906 --> 00:07:36,350
What business ?

66
00:07:37,307 --> 00:07:39,720
They sell pirated video CD 's .

67
00:09:40,630 --> 00:09:42,610
Good morning !

68
00:09:42,832 --> 00:09:44,835
Be careful , Billy !

69
00:09:45,937 --> 00:09:47,745
Joy , we 're leaving now . You ?

70
00:09:48,239 --> 00:09:51,118
You know my schedule . Nestor will pick me up .

71
00:09:51,642 --> 00:09:53,552
- Dad , I 'll sit in front ! - Use the seat belt .

72
00:09:53,644 --> 00:09:54,621
Yes , Dad !

73
00:10:10,927 --> 00:10:12,201
M " " w ?

74
00:10:14,097 --> 00:10:15,770
Coming , Nestor !

75
00:10:24,442 --> 00:10:27,980
- Good morning , Nestor ! - Good morning , Ma 'am !

76
00:10:28,078 --> 00:10:30,581
Let 's go to the bank first , then to the bus stop , okay ?

77
00:10:30,681 --> 00:10:31,658
Yes , Ma 'am !

78
00:10:34,619 --> 00:10:37,929
I almost won the lottery last night .

79
00:10:38,022 --> 00:10:40,195
Just missed it by one number !

80
00:10:57,908 --> 00:11:01,412
Don 't you find it hard to adjust ? Your place is far !

81
00:11:02,046 --> 00:11:03,991
The new house takes getting used to ...

82
00:11:04,081 --> 00:11:06,788
but I can really see lnton is determined now .

83
00:11:07,350 --> 00:11:10,559
I feel that we 're really a family .

84
00:11:10,855 --> 00:11:14,826
You know what 's also great ? In that house , there 's just us .

85
00:11:14,924 --> 00:11:18,303
Nobody meddles .

86
00:11:18,928 --> 00:11:20,635
- Good morning , Sir . - Good morning , Sir .

87
00:11:20,730 --> 00:11:23,506
Alice , the teachers from San Juan are here .

88
00:11:23,801 --> 00:11:25,438
Yes , Sir . We 're going .

89
00:11:25,536 --> 00:11:26,980
- Let 's go . - Okay , you go and talk to ...

90
00:11:27,038 --> 00:11:29,917
Since you are full of positive energy today ...

91
00:11:30,341 --> 00:11:33,480
you 'll enjoy recruiting possible members .

92
00:11:34,077 --> 00:11:36,820
Since I am migrating to Canada ...

93
00:11:37,148 --> 00:11:41,028
I 'm leaving them to you , instead of giving them to others .

94
00:11:41,418 --> 00:11:43,625
Alice , there are so many of them !

95
00:11:43,821 --> 00:11:45,197
I might fail !

96
00:11:45,956 --> 00:11:47,400
You can do it .

97
00:11:48,024 --> 00:11:49,003
Okay ?

98
00:11:50,226 --> 00:11:51,672
All right .

99
00:11:51,961 --> 00:11:55,739
I 'll cover you if you buckle .

100
00:11:56,567 --> 00:11:58,477
I 'll be there for you .

101
00:12:00,504 --> 00:12:01,744
Let 's go .

102
00:12:02,840 --> 00:12:05,615
- Alice ... - Come on ! You can do it ! Let 's go .

103
00:12:05,875 --> 00:12:07,081
Let 's go inside .

104
00:12:08,245 --> 00:12:09,417
Good morning !

105
00:12:09,513 --> 00:12:12,187
- Good morning ! - Good morning !

106
00:12:13,250 --> 00:12:15,230
Do you want to earn fast ?

107
00:12:15,318 --> 00:12:17,355
Then let 's give a hand to my friend ...

108
00:12:17,455 --> 00:12:18,831
Joy Ramirez !

109
00:12:23,394 --> 00:12:26,705
How 's everybody doing ? Can I request for a smile ?

110
00:12:26,797 --> 00:12:29,174
Do you know why we should all smile ?

111
00:12:29,265 --> 00:12:33,111
Because all of us will soon be wealthy !

112
00:13:04,434 --> 00:13:05,413
Demon ?

113
00:13:07,171 --> 00:13:10,118
Okay , everybody ! You listen up , everybody .

114
00:13:10,441 --> 00:13:12,886
Today is a very special day for us ...

115
00:13:12,976 --> 00:13:16,355
because for the first time in the history of our company ...

116
00:13:16,647 --> 00:13:21,221
someone has reached maximum sales in one sitting !

117
00:13:21,451 --> 00:13:23,192
This is truly phenomenal !

118
00:13:23,287 --> 00:13:26,325
So , I 'd like to acknowledge the person responsible for this ...

119
00:13:26,624 --> 00:13:28,034
Mrs. Joy Ramirez !

120
00:13:28,192 --> 00:13:30,229
Let 's give her a big hand ! Come on , everybody .

121
00:13:32,562 --> 00:13:34,008
Congratulations !

122
00:13:35,599 --> 00:13:38,205
Joy , congratulations .

123
00:13:40,070 --> 00:13:42,676
Include this on the bill , okay ?

124
00:13:43,740 --> 00:13:45,778
Alice , I 'll just take this pink one .

125
00:13:45,875 --> 00:13:48,447
I 'll return these three . I 'm sorry .

126
00:13:49,413 --> 00:13:51,323
- Good evening , Ma 'am ! - How are you , Beth ?

127
00:13:51,481 --> 00:13:52,460
I 'm fine , Ma 'am .

128
00:14:00,157 --> 00:14:01,726
Mommy 's here !

129
00:14:02,158 --> 00:14:05,105
- Hi , Mommy ! Good evening , Mommy ! - Hi , Mommy ! Good evening , Mommy !

130
00:14:06,831 --> 00:14:07,740
Where 's your Daddy ?

131
00:14:08,097 --> 00:14:10,543
He called and said he 's still out with a client .

132
00:14:10,768 --> 00:14:13,248
How 's life in your new house ?

133
00:14:13,770 --> 00:14:14,875
Good evening .

134
00:14:15,940 --> 00:14:17,681
Let 's go home while it 's early .

135
00:14:17,807 --> 00:14:19,081
Go get your things !

136
00:14:19,509 --> 00:14:20,852
Are you better off now ?

137
00:14:21,044 --> 00:14:23,115
Can 't we stay here longer , Mommy ?

138
00:14:24,347 --> 00:14:26,953
I wish your life finally improves in that house .

139
00:14:27,618 --> 00:14:30,258
We have our own house . That 's why we 're going home .

140
00:14:30,520 --> 00:14:32,932
Mommy , there are so many insects there !

141
00:14:33,224 --> 00:14:35,067
Ingrid , don 't be difficult .

142
00:14:35,259 --> 00:14:38,899
Joy , they can sleep here while waiting for lnton .

143
00:14:40,831 --> 00:14:43,937
Please tell lnton I picked up the kids .

144
00:14:45,936 --> 00:14:50,282
Get your things now , because a taxi 's waiting !

145
00:14:50,540 --> 00:14:51,780
We 're taking a taxi ?

146
00:14:53,711 --> 00:14:54,951
So you are better off !

147
00:15:13,397 --> 00:15:14,705
Brown-out ?

148
00:15:14,899 --> 00:15:17,674
It can 't be . There 's light on the post .

149
00:15:20,770 --> 00:15:23,581
Stay here , you two . Mommy will get the flashlight .

150
00:15:23,974 --> 00:15:26,852
We should 've slept at Grandma 's .

151
00:15:27,311 --> 00:15:29,086
Ingrid ...

152
00:15:30,246 --> 00:15:31,590
Mommy !

153
00:15:32,249 --> 00:15:33,489
You ' re weird !

154
00:16:05,014 --> 00:16:06,585
Guard , what are you doing there ?

155
00:16:08,351 --> 00:16:09,695
Just checking , Ma 'am .

156
00:16:12,456 --> 00:16:15,437
The lights were on a while ago .

157
00:16:15,893 --> 00:16:17,873
Seems there were people inside .

158
00:16:18,629 --> 00:16:22,543
But when I approached , the lights went out .

159
00:16:24,033 --> 00:16:25,536
How can that be ?

160
00:16:25,635 --> 00:16:27,774
- We just got home . - Who 's that ?

161
00:16:30,240 --> 00:16:32,947
Can I borrow a spare fuse ?

162
00:16:35,312 --> 00:16:37,258
Okay , I 'll check .

163
00:16:40,650 --> 00:16:42,857
Mommy , my pet !

164
00:16:43,988 --> 00:16:45,466
What happened to it ?

165
00:16:46,557 --> 00:16:47,865
I 'm sorry , son .

166
00:16:54,398 --> 00:16:57,379
- Sorry about your pet . - It 's okay .

167
00:17:04,741 --> 00:17:06,914
Mommy , something broke !

168
00:17:18,955 --> 00:17:22,096
Pity . This was a gift from Aunt Thelma .

169
00:17:22,358 --> 00:17:24,737
She said it attracts good luck .

170
00:17:34,171 --> 00:17:36,173
I hope we don 't get unlucky .

171
00:18:17,080 --> 00:18:18,252
Daddy !

172
00:18:22,419 --> 00:18:24,329
Daddy , my slink died .

173
00:18:24,421 --> 00:18:28,392
- Then my basketball got lost . - Daddy , there was a brown-out earlier .

174
00:18:28,491 --> 00:18:30,199
There are more crickets now .

175
00:18:30,294 --> 00:18:34,935
Inton , these two did nothing but complain the whole time .

176
00:18:35,031 --> 00:18:36,807
Let 's talk about that later .

177
00:18:37,366 --> 00:18:40,211
Listen , your Daddy got promoted .

178
00:18:40,703 --> 00:18:44,584
I closed my 1.5 million contract with ten percent commission .

179
00:18:44,674 --> 00:18:46,551
We get 150,000 !

180
00:18:46,977 --> 00:18:48,080
Congratulate your Daddy !

181
00:18:48,144 --> 00:18:51,751
- Congratulations ! - Congratulations !

182
00:18:51,981 --> 00:18:53,358
You think you 're the only one ?

183
00:18:53,717 --> 00:18:54,694
I did well too .

184
00:18:54,852 --> 00:18:56,832
I exceeded my quota today .

185
00:18:56,920 --> 00:18:58,762
Guess how much commission I got ?

186
00:18:58,822 --> 00:18:59,799
How much ?

187
00:19:00,457 --> 00:19:02,903
250,000 !

188
00:19:03,126 --> 00:19:05,767
Won 't you congratulate your Mommy ?

189
00:19:06,063 --> 00:19:08,304
- Congratulations ! - Congratulations !

190
00:19:08,397 --> 00:19:10,469
- Happy Valentine ! - Congratulations .

191
00:19:11,335 --> 00:19:12,507
We 're so lucky !

192
00:19:12,935 --> 00:19:15,347
So I proved your mother wrong .

193
00:19:15,538 --> 00:19:16,517
About what ?

194
00:19:16,807 --> 00:19:18,945
That I 'm a burden in your life .

195
00:19:20,210 --> 00:19:21,586
Don 't be silly .

196
00:19:24,347 --> 00:19:28,454
- Daddy , look for my ball ! - Come , Ingrid .

197
00:19:28,551 --> 00:19:30,963
Denton , your Daddy hasn 't eaten yet .

198
00:19:31,488 --> 00:19:33,558
Hey , we 're eating !

199
00:19:50,641 --> 00:19:52,211
Dad , did you find it ?

200
00:19:52,776 --> 00:19:54,153
I can 't see a thing .

201
00:19:55,045 --> 00:19:57,082
It can 't just disappear .

202
00:19:57,713 --> 00:19:59,317
Maybe it rolled to the far end .

203
00:19:59,883 --> 00:20:02,124
I 'll look for it when I have time .

204
00:20:02,786 --> 00:20:03,763
Not now .

205
00:20:14,263 --> 00:20:16,835
This is my list of prime clients .

206
00:20:16,933 --> 00:20:19,846
I 'm giving this to you here , instead of at the office .

207
00:20:19,936 --> 00:20:22,178
I don 't want them to get envious .

208
00:20:22,673 --> 00:20:25,346
Really ? Thanks .

209
00:20:26,076 --> 00:20:29,182
So this means you really won 't be coming back ?

210
00:20:29,712 --> 00:20:33,057
I thought you 'll just try it out in Canada .

211
00:20:33,784 --> 00:20:36,855
Dado doesn 't want us to be separated again .

212
00:20:37,153 --> 00:20:38,461
Isn 't that sweet ?

213
00:20:38,689 --> 00:20:41,259
If ever , we 'll be back only for vacations .

214
00:20:41,357 --> 00:20:43,201
Maybe in Laguna .

215
00:20:44,827 --> 00:20:47,104
Why is the Bagua on the door ?

216
00:20:47,431 --> 00:20:49,342
It will move and swing here .

217
00:20:49,900 --> 00:20:51,105
Do you have a hammer ?

218
00:20:54,971 --> 00:20:56,541
The Bagua is like an altar .

219
00:20:56,839 --> 00:21:00,413
It should be fixed on the sturdiest part of the house .

220
00:21:01,377 --> 00:21:04,415
Maybe that 's why you 've been getting all this luck .

221
00:21:05,648 --> 00:21:07,355
Alice , it 's weird ...

222
00:21:07,917 --> 00:21:10,693
I wasn 't the only one who closed a big deal yesterday .

223
00:21:11,755 --> 00:21:13,028
Inton too .

224
00:21:13,656 --> 00:21:16,160
Luck 's like that when it comes .

225
00:21:16,393 --> 00:21:18,930
When it rains , it pours , so to speak .

226
00:21:19,028 --> 00:21:22,703
I 'm afraid there might be some kind of price for all this .

227
00:21:22,965 --> 00:21:26,310
You should be thankful because it 's good luck you get .

228
00:21:29,105 --> 00:21:32,519
Maybe you have a dwarf here ? Or a good spirit ?

229
00:21:34,778 --> 00:21:36,758
I do feel a presence .

230
00:21:37,346 --> 00:21:40,156
That might be your luck .

231
00:21:40,349 --> 00:21:43,455
Don 't scare it away and don 't upset it .

232
00:21:43,787 --> 00:21:46,665
How can we do that to something we can 't see ?

233
00:21:47,124 --> 00:21:49,104
Our friends said ...

234
00:21:49,192 --> 00:21:53,902
no loud music , no shouting and no quarreling .

235
00:21:54,230 --> 00:21:57,473
Sometimes , offer it food and drinks .

236
00:21:57,634 --> 00:22:00,342
Talk to it once in a while .

237
00:22:00,971 --> 00:22:04,009
You know , you 're starting to scare me .

238
00:22:04,641 --> 00:22:06,814
I don 't want something bad to happen to us here .

239
00:22:06,910 --> 00:22:10,288
Don 't worry . It 's a tried and tested formula .

240
00:22:19,588 --> 00:22:22,398
We have a special promo . Good afternoon , Ma 'am .

241
00:22:22,459 --> 00:22:26,099
Pick one . You could be the next grand prize winner .

242
00:22:27,530 --> 00:22:28,770
What 's the grand prize ?

243
00:22:28,832 --> 00:22:30,903
10 thousand pesos worth of gift cheques !

244
00:22:31,000 --> 00:22:34,574
Plus a chance to win the grand prize of a home entertainment showcase .

245
00:22:34,938 --> 00:22:37,417
- Ma 'am , what did you get ? - Star .

246
00:22:37,507 --> 00:22:41,147
Wow , congratulations ! You 're the lucky shopper !

247
00:22:41,478 --> 00:22:44,891
You 're very lucky , you won !

248
00:22:57,160 --> 00:22:58,194
Is that true ?

249
00:22:58,295 --> 00:23:01,741
Uncle Teodoro said it 's true that there are spirits .

250
00:23:02,098 --> 00:23:04,409
It 's also the belief of the church .

251
00:23:04,734 --> 00:23:09,775
When we say something over and over , the effect is like a prayer .

252
00:23:12,909 --> 00:23:14,217
I offer you .

253
00:23:15,545 --> 00:23:18,616
Please bless lnton with luck in his plans .

254
00:23:21,117 --> 00:23:25,692
- Spirit , spirit , can we be your friend ? - Spirit , spirit , can we be your friend ?

255
00:23:25,989 --> 00:23:28,868
- If it 's okay , show yourself to us . - If it 's okay , show yourself to us .

256
00:23:28,924 --> 00:23:31,769
- If not , just give us a sign . - If not , just give us a sign .

257
00:23:31,862 --> 00:23:35,308
- But don 't scare us . Amen . - But don 't scare us . Amen .

258
00:23:39,502 --> 00:23:44,212
- Spirit , spirit , can we be your friend ? - Spirit , spirit , can we be your friend ?

259
00:23:44,407 --> 00:23:47,445
- If it 's okay , show yourself to us . - If it 's okay , show yourself to us .

