529
00:45:53,335 --> 00:45:55,143
Indeed , I became lucky .

530
00:45:55,871 --> 00:45:59,478
But people were dying one by one .

531
00:46:00,275 --> 00:46:03,518
Like you , I wanted to know why .

532
00:46:04,480 --> 00:46:07,518
Soon , everything became clear .

533
00:46:08,817 --> 00:46:11,922
Whoever sees himself in the mirror dies .

534
00:46:13,822 --> 00:46:17,099
My mistake was telling my husband .

535
00:46:19,027 --> 00:46:21,940
Meaning Biring and Nestor ...

536
00:46:24,932 --> 00:46:27,277
- What if ... - You have nothing to worry about .

537
00:46:27,835 --> 00:46:29,577
You own the Bagua .

538
00:46:30,172 --> 00:46:31,583
You don 't have the curse .

539
00:46:31,773 --> 00:46:34,014
You have the blessing of luck .

540
00:46:34,943 --> 00:46:37,548
Did you try ending the curse ?

541
00:46:39,882 --> 00:46:41,259
How strange ?

542
00:46:42,251 --> 00:46:44,753
That 's exactly what my husband said .

543
00:46:45,387 --> 00:46:47,195
I want the curse to end .

544
00:46:47,289 --> 00:46:50,030
The luck will also end . They 're connected .

545
00:46:50,125 --> 00:46:51,831
I don 't want this kind of life !

546
00:46:51,927 --> 00:46:54,065
Then give me back the mirror !

547
00:46:54,262 --> 00:46:57,938
Even if I do , the curse still won 't end .

548
00:46:58,634 --> 00:47:00,773
Two people you know already died .

549
00:47:00,869 --> 00:47:02,211
How many more ?

550
00:47:02,403 --> 00:47:03,643
Your neighbor ?

551
00:47:04,072 --> 00:47:05,050
Friend ?

552
00:47:05,340 --> 00:47:06,751
Husband ? Children ?

553
00:47:07,409 --> 00:47:10,413
Can you risk your loved ones ' lives ?

554
00:47:14,817 --> 00:47:16,626
Thank you for your time .

555
00:47:17,619 --> 00:47:19,291
Bring me back the mirror !

556
00:47:19,420 --> 00:47:20,728
I 'll pay you !

557
00:48:21,884 --> 00:48:23,989
- My God ! - Mommy !

558
00:48:24,119 --> 00:48:26,599
- Mommy ! - We 've been waiting for you !

559
00:48:29,423 --> 00:48:30,800
He 's Atty . Ocampo .

560
00:48:31,559 --> 00:48:32,561
Good evening , Ma 'am .

561
00:48:33,295 --> 00:48:37,572
The lawyer of Mrs. Francisco , your Networking client in Batangas ?

562
00:48:38,432 --> 00:48:41,242
Well , she died last week .

563
00:48:42,204 --> 00:48:43,181
What ?

564
00:48:43,271 --> 00:48:45,148
What happened to Boots ?

565
00:48:45,806 --> 00:48:46,876
She died of stroke .

566
00:48:52,581 --> 00:48:55,083
Joy , she left you an inheritance .

567
00:48:55,751 --> 00:48:57,423
You must 've been her favorite .

568
00:48:57,753 --> 00:48:59,755
5 hectares of land in Batangas !

569
00:48:59,987 --> 00:49:01,432
With a private beach resort !

570
00:49:04,659 --> 00:49:06,764
She left a will .

571
00:49:07,262 --> 00:49:09,469
And I would like to read this to you in part .

572
00:49:11,065 --> 00:49:12,875
For Joy Ramirez ...

573
00:49:13,335 --> 00:49:15,838
who was a big part of my life ...

574
00:49:16,003 --> 00:49:17,574
who served as bridge ...

575
00:49:17,806 --> 00:49:21,184
and opened the road so that I may reach my dreams ...

576
00:49:21,476 --> 00:49:24,480
and give a good life to my family .

577
00:49:25,112 --> 00:49:32,655
I leave 5 hectares of land to her ...

578
00:49:40,628 --> 00:49:44,304
Joy , you 've been quiet .

579
00:49:45,132 --> 00:49:47,170
Aren 't you happy with the inheritance ?

580
00:49:49,003 --> 00:49:52,213
You didn 't even ask about my trip or howl am .

581
00:49:52,373 --> 00:49:53,614
What 's wrong with you ?

582
00:50:01,182 --> 00:50:02,958
What happened during your trip ?

583
00:50:06,420 --> 00:50:08,094
I didn 't know it was that far .

584
00:50:08,389 --> 00:50:09,960
The trip was tiring .

585
00:50:10,324 --> 00:50:11,429
But it ' s okay .

586
00:50:12,193 --> 00:50:13,672
The mission was a success .

587
00:50:14,730 --> 00:50:16,641
My boss was happy with my work .

588
00:50:17,132 --> 00:50:19,442
He might make me Regional Manager of Cebu .

589
00:50:23,137 --> 00:50:24,775
If our luck continues ...

590
00:50:25,273 --> 00:50:27,684
we 'll have not only a rest house in Batangas .

591
00:50:28,476 --> 00:50:30,320
We 'll also buy a house in Alabang .

592
00:50:31,612 --> 00:50:34,422
We won 't sell this house .

593
00:50:34,516 --> 00:50:36,757
Because this is the source of all our luck .

594
00:50:44,893 --> 00:50:46,269
Why look at me like that ?

595
00:50:48,230 --> 00:50:50,175
Aren 't you happy with my good fortune ?

596
00:50:50,532 --> 00:50:53,034
And with yours ?

597
00:50:53,367 --> 00:50:54,539
Aren 't you happy ?

598
00:50:57,304 --> 00:50:59,251
You 're so fortunate , lnton .

599
00:51:00,641 --> 00:51:02,588
You get everything you want .

600
00:51:11,820 --> 00:51:13,059
Don 't be so naive , Joy .

601
00:51:14,856 --> 00:51:18,099
A man can 't get everything he wants .

602
00:51:18,793 --> 00:51:20,034
You 're still fortunate , Joy .

603
00:51:20,561 --> 00:51:21,699
Believe me .

604
00:51:27,235 --> 00:51:28,509
My laundry .

605
00:51:32,273 --> 00:51:33,719
Be satisfied with what you have !

606
00:51:51,293 --> 00:51:53,534
- Daddy , someone 's looking at us ... - Daddy , come here !

607
00:51:53,594 --> 00:51:56,768
- from the vacant house ! - Denton , the things you see at this hour !

608
00:51:56,831 --> 00:51:58,971
- Take a look ! - If there 's nothing there ...

609
00:51:59,067 --> 00:52:00,978
you 'll both get spanking from me .

610
00:52:01,335 --> 00:52:03,315
- Where ? - Down in the window .

611
00:52:03,438 --> 00:52:05,509
- Down there . - Did you see it , Dad ?

612
00:52:05,606 --> 00:52:07,552
- Who could it be ? - The one in white !

613
00:52:08,476 --> 00:52:09,784
- Denton ! Ingrid ! - Mommy !

614
00:52:09,878 --> 00:52:11,152
- Don 't look there ! - Mommy !

615
00:52:11,246 --> 00:52:12,418
Don 't look !

616
00:52:12,547 --> 00:52:15,289
- Inton , call the guard ! - Mommy !

617
00:52:24,659 --> 00:52:26,297
Stay here . I 'll check it out .

618
00:52:37,139 --> 00:52:39,516
Stay here . Mommy will just take a look .

619
00:52:39,807 --> 00:52:41,684
Mommy .

620
00:52:42,010 --> 00:52:44,786
Denton , keep an eye on Ingrid ! Don 't follow !

621
00:52:53,188 --> 00:52:55,190
This is the village security camera .

622
00:52:55,590 --> 00:52:57,228
Looks like he was bitten by a snake !

623
00:53:00,561 --> 00:53:01,563
Let 's take a look .

624
00:53:02,797 --> 00:53:04,139
Why did he videotape us ?

625
00:53:22,184 --> 00:53:23,322
How did this happen ?

626
00:53:23,885 --> 00:53:25,329
Who are those people ?

627
00:53:27,155 --> 00:53:29,157
Only my family and the lawyer were there .

628
00:53:36,097 --> 00:53:37,507
Get away from there !

629
00:53:38,266 --> 00:53:38,835
- Mommy ! - Joy !

630
00:53:38,934 --> 00:53:40,708
Not the kids !

631
00:53:43,804 --> 00:53:44,782
Joy !

632
00:53:46,440 --> 00:53:48,045
- Daddy ! - What happened ?

633
00:53:48,143 --> 00:53:49,382
Where are you ?

634
00:53:49,476 --> 00:53:51,650
What happened to Mommy ?

635
00:53:56,818 --> 00:53:58,422
Go away !

636
00:53:59,820 --> 00:54:01,391
Joy , what 's wrong with you ?

637
00:54:13,034 --> 00:54:18,005
The security guard , 39 years old , year of the snake .

638
00:54:18,106 --> 00:54:19,516
Bitten by a snake .

639
00:54:21,610 --> 00:54:23,920
I talked to Evan 's wife .

640
00:54:25,045 --> 00:54:27,322
She wants the Bagua back .

641
00:54:28,382 --> 00:54:30,521
She said it brings good luck .

642
00:54:31,719 --> 00:54:36,829
But with it , bad luck too , to whoever sees himself in the mirror .

643
00:54:39,126 --> 00:54:40,538
Then last night ...

644
00:54:42,764 --> 00:54:43,902
lnton ...

645
00:54:46,201 --> 00:54:47,873
He already hinted ...

646
00:54:49,436 --> 00:54:53,077
that I should accept his affair with Dina again .

647
00:54:57,811 --> 00:55:01,282
Good morning . Mr. Xiu Liao is waiting for you .

648
00:55:20,568 --> 00:55:26,108
To my knowledge this Bagua was owned by siblings ...

649
00:55:26,440 --> 00:55:30,753
in one of the richest families in Shanghai then .

650
00:55:31,545 --> 00:55:36,291
When the revolution started and the communists prevailed ...

651
00:55:36,583 --> 00:55:42,159
the rich and the allies of Sun Yat Sen evacuated .

652
00:55:43,157 --> 00:55:48,266
The brother escaped with his wives and children .

653
00:55:48,929 --> 00:55:55,505
But he left his sister because he said she was a burden .

654
00:55:55,936 --> 00:56:02,876
Now , this sister is what we call Lotus Feet .

655
00:56:03,677 --> 00:56:08,525
This is a deep tradition among rich Chinese ...

656
00:56:08,882 --> 00:56:13,422
where the feet of young girls are bound ...

657
00:56:13,521 --> 00:56:16,262
and placed inside an iron shoes ...

658
00:56:17,192 --> 00:56:22,664
to prevent the normal growth of their feet .

659
00:56:24,099 --> 00:56:31,175
It was too late when she found out that she was abandoned by her servants .

660
00:56:31,739 --> 00:56:36,347
They ran away and joined the communist army .

661
00:56:36,744 --> 00:56:41,659
They even led the burning of their Master 's mansion .

662
00:56:42,784 --> 00:56:49,065
Lotus Feet could not run or walk .

663
00:56:49,657 --> 00:56:51,101
She was burned by the fire .

664
00:56:51,893 --> 00:56:57,934
They say she was embracing this Bagua ...

665
00:56:58,766 --> 00:57:00,871
while she was burning .

666
00:57:02,302 --> 00:57:07,775
She swore in the mirror before she died .

667
00:57:08,342 --> 00:57:11,688
The curse was to get the soul ...

668
00:57:11,980 --> 00:57:15,586
of anyone who sees himself in the mirror .

669
00:57:18,085 --> 00:57:21,396
How many souls will she take before she gets her revenge ?

670
00:57:22,356 --> 00:57:23,699
Nobody knows .

671
00:57:24,192 --> 00:57:26,228
She takes even the non-Chinese ?

672
00:57:27,228 --> 00:57:28,467
Anybody .

673
00:57:28,797 --> 00:57:30,867
Why don 't we just break the mirror ?

674
00:57:30,998 --> 00:57:31,976
Never do that !

675
00:57:32,300 --> 00:57:33,980
It will just return to its original state .

676
00:57:34,601 --> 00:57:39,813
And if you do that , the soul of the owner will be taken too .

677
00:57:40,507 --> 00:57:45,958
Don 't attempt anything unless it is the right solution .

678
00:57:47,148 --> 00:57:49,822
How can we save those who looked in the mirror ?

679
00:57:50,217 --> 00:57:51,719
How do we end the curse ?

680
00:57:52,686 --> 00:57:53,688
I don 't know .

681
00:57:56,391 --> 00:58:00,463
I will search the answers from the old books .

682
00:58:08,702 --> 00:58:11,581
I may have looked in the mirror .

683
00:58:13,775 --> 00:58:15,617
Why didn 't you say earlier ?

684
00:58:16,177 --> 00:58:17,713
Because I wasn 't so sure .

685
00:58:19,012 --> 00:58:21,425
Besides , the old man said he can 't do anything .

686
00:58:24,085 --> 00:58:28,965
Joy , do you remember ...

687
00:58:29,657 --> 00:58:31,329
when I removed the Bagua from the door ?

688
00:58:33,293 --> 00:58:35,864
I think , I looked in the mirror .

689
00:58:38,465 --> 00:58:42,608
We don 't know who 'll be next .

690
00:58:43,804 --> 00:58:46,512
Could be you , another guard , or ...

691
00:58:46,740 --> 00:58:47,719
lnton ...

692
00:58:49,543 --> 00:58:51,079
or the kids .

693
00:58:54,782 --> 00:58:56,226
Alice , I 'll stay with you .

694
00:58:56,885 --> 00:58:58,728
You stay with lnton and the kids .

695
00:58:59,653 --> 00:59:01,291
Let 's not leave them .

696
00:59:01,389 --> 00:59:03,630
We might be able to help them , just in case .

697
00:59:04,259 --> 00:59:07,206
Joy , when you get lucky again , please call me immediately .

698
00:59:08,730 --> 00:59:10,300
Because then , we know what follows ...

699
00:59:10,898 --> 00:59:11,876
the curse .

700
00:59:30,684 --> 00:59:33,824
Why are you studying here ?

701
00:59:34,322 --> 00:59:35,858
Mommy doesn 't want us to study in our room .

702
00:59:35,956 --> 00:59:38,494
We are really studying .

703
00:59:40,394 --> 00:59:44,639
Maybe you 're just playing in your room . That 's why she wants you to do it here .

704
00:59:56,210 --> 00:59:57,210
That 's my phone !

705
00:59:59,079 --> 01:00:00,320
Hope it 's not my Boss .

706
01:00:01,715 --> 01:00:04,525
He 's been bugging me to accompany his client to a bar .

707
01:00:22,135 --> 01:00:23,581
Let me check your assignment .

708
01:00:23,670 --> 01:00:25,275
Mommy , I 'm not finished .

709
01:00:25,606 --> 01:00:27,416
I 'm done .

710
01:00:29,643 --> 01:00:31,248
Umbrella .

711
01:00:31,512 --> 01:00:33,422
Your answer on this one should be " B " .

712
01:00:34,349 --> 01:00:37,056
Joy , I have to go .

713
01:00:39,086 --> 01:00:40,293
I won 't be long .

714
01:00:40,621 --> 01:00:43,398
I 'll just show up .

715
01:00:50,398 --> 01:00:51,967
Mommy will get something upstairs .

716
01:00:52,300 --> 01:00:53,438
Finish that .

717
01:01:00,041 --> 01:01:01,644
Inton , I don 't want you to go .

718
01:01:02,610 --> 01:01:03,815
This is important , Joy .

719
01:01:04,679 --> 01:01:06,157
I don 't want you to get hurt .

720
01:01:07,248 --> 01:01:08,693
Why will I get hurt ?

721
01:01:12,152 --> 01:01:13,632
I won 't get drunk .

722
01:01:13,887 --> 01:01:16,630
It would be embarrassing to the clients .

723
01:01:17,190 --> 01:01:19,101
I know it 's not work .

724
01:01:20,661 --> 01:01:21,902
What are you talking about ?

725
01:01:22,896 --> 01:01:28,005
What you said last night that I 'm lucky you still go home to me .

726
01:01:28,503 --> 01:01:30,641
I know you 're back with Dina .

727
01:01:32,873 --> 01:01:34,114
Joy , what 's with you ?

728
01:01:35,543 --> 01:01:36,782
Where did you hear that ?

729
01:01:37,411 --> 01:01:38,389
I saw you .

730
01:01:39,547 --> 01:01:41,925
You were fetching Dina before you went to La Union .

731
01:01:43,284 --> 01:01:47,891
If you had looked around you would 've seen me ...

732
01:01:49,590 --> 01:01:53,503
while you were telling me on the phone that you 're on the express highway .

733
01:01:54,528 --> 01:01:57,065
I clearly saw you leave the parking lot .

734
01:02:00,702 --> 01:02:04,376
Do you know what I felt when I saw you with Dina ?

735
01:02:08,976 --> 01:02:10,478
I love you , lnton .

736
01:02:11,179 --> 01:02:12,782
Your kids love you .

737
01:02:13,981 --> 01:02:17,518
I hope you honor your promise that it 's over with Dina ...

738
01:02:17,585 --> 01:02:19,257
because she 's married .

739
01:02:19,954 --> 01:02:22,456
Leave them with their own lives .

740
01:02:27,427 --> 01:02:28,405
They ' re separated .

741
01:02:28,663 --> 01:02:30,233
Because of you .

742
01:02:30,565 --> 01:02:32,010
I 'm not the reason , Joy .

743
01:02:32,333 --> 01:02:33,835
Then you have to choose .

744
01:02:34,402 --> 01:02:36,574
Me and your kids , or Dina ?

745
01:02:40,041 --> 01:02:42,987
I know you 'll choose me because I 'm your wife .

746
01:02:45,847 --> 01:02:47,757
And Dina has her husband .

747
01:02:50,617 --> 01:02:52,324
Must it come to this , Joy ?

748
01:03:01,362 --> 01:03:02,431
I 'm going .

749
01:03:03,831 --> 01:03:05,275
Inton , wait !

750
01:03:06,333 --> 01:03:09,213
I have to tell you something about what 's happening now ...

751
01:03:09,302 --> 01:03:11,407
but it 's hard to explain .

752
01:03:12,672 --> 01:03:14,193
You 're the one that 's hard to explain .

753
01:03:22,516 --> 01:03:24,655
Daddy , someone 's at the door .

754
01:03:27,688 --> 01:03:28,666
Who is it ?

755
01:03:29,157 --> 01:03:30,760
They 're looking for Mommy .

756
01:03:34,929 --> 01:03:35,907
Come .

757
01:03:44,237 --> 01:03:46,581
Is this the house of Mrs. Joy Ramirez ?

758
01:03:47,340 --> 01:03:48,318
Yes .

759
01:03:48,576 --> 01:03:50,612
We ' re sorry to arrive this late .

760
01:03:50,710 --> 01:03:52,849
- Your address was hard to find . - Denton , the bike .

761
01:03:53,648 --> 01:03:59,063
Sir , we brought her prize . The Home Entertainment showcase .

762
01:03:59,152 --> 01:04:01,599
- That 's huge ! - I wonder what 's inside them ?

763
01:04:02,023 --> 01:04:03,001
Mommy , what 's this ?

764
01:04:04,458 --> 01:04:06,096
You won these .

765
01:04:06,427 --> 01:04:08,565
We phoned you the other night .

766
01:04:10,565 --> 01:04:13,239
Mommy , we 're so lucky !

767
01:04:13,333 --> 01:04:14,835
Ingrid , Denton , come here !

768
01:04:15,001 --> 01:04:16,742
Hurry ! Come over here !

769
01:04:16,871 --> 01:04:18,407
Here beside me ! Denton !

770
01:04:18,505 --> 01:04:19,416
Joy !

771
01:04:20,842 --> 01:04:26,554
Ma 'am , can you please sign here ? Sorry to bother you .

772
01:04:27,181 --> 01:04:28,853
- I 'll have her sign it . - Thank you , Sir .

773
01:04:33,521 --> 01:04:34,498
Sign it .

774
01:04:39,059 --> 01:04:40,094
Sign it !

775
01:04:50,503 --> 01:04:53,643
Now you have material bondage that 's hard to fight ...

776
01:04:53,708 --> 01:04:55,550
because of all the inﬂuences .

777
01:04:56,043 --> 01:05:01,425
Like greed , lust , vices and more to come .

778
01:05:01,581 --> 01:05:03,391
It will hurt your heart .

779
01:05:03,851 --> 01:05:08,822
But you have to fight them even if your guilt makes you cry .

780
01:05:09,389 --> 01:05:14,065
You really have to plan your next move .

781
01:05:18,099 --> 01:05:19,134
Be careful .

782
01:05:20,300 --> 01:05:21,974
We 're already disturbing them . Hurry up !

783
01:05:23,304 --> 01:05:24,077
What 's that ?

784
01:05:24,972 --> 01:05:26,507
Inton , don 't got out !

785
01:05:30,443 --> 01:05:32,014
You might get hit !

786
01:05:43,925 --> 01:05:46,030
Sir , Ma 'am , everything 's there .

787
01:05:46,527 --> 01:05:48,768
We 'll go now . Thank you .

788
01:05:52,266 --> 01:05:54,302
- Sounds like it came from Billy 's ! - Ingrid .

789
01:05:55,001 --> 01:05:56,344
Denton , come back here !

790
01:05:56,436 --> 01:05:58,541
- Denton ! - Dad , was it from Billy 's ?

791
01:06:02,443 --> 01:06:04,012
The shot came from Billy 's place !

792
01:06:04,077 --> 01:06:06,023
He might be hurt !

793
01:06:06,280 --> 01:06:07,257
- Denton ! - Denton !

