Take him to the hospital .

1062
01:26:34,707 --> 01:26:36,208
Lift ! Lift ! All right !

1063
01:26:36,442 --> 01:26:39,252
Billy is alive . Right , Mommy ?

1064
01:26:39,345 --> 01:26:42,326
- Bring him to the car . - Move !

1065
01:26:42,381 --> 01:26:45,225
Yes , but we must take him to the hospital .

1066
01:26:45,318 --> 01:26:47,559
Guard , please take Denton home .

1067
01:26:47,787 --> 01:26:52,429
Tell Aunt Thelma to treat your wound and tell her I 'll call from the hospital .

1068
01:26:52,492 --> 01:26:53,492
- Okay , son ? - Yes , Mommy .

1069
01:26:55,194 --> 01:26:57,105
I 'll take you home , Denton .

1070
01:27:52,918 --> 01:27:57,025
The boy lost a lot of blood . The problem is his blood type is rare .

1071
01:27:57,122 --> 01:27:59,432
We have no stock of type AB .

1072
01:28:00,193 --> 01:28:03,332
We used to get it from the American bases ...

1073
01:28:03,429 --> 01:28:04,708
but there are no more bases now .

1074
01:28:05,398 --> 01:28:06,376
When now ' ?

1075
01:28:06,532 --> 01:28:10,036
The surgeon doesn 't want to proceed without blood ...

1076
01:28:10,136 --> 01:28:11,979
or the boy won 't survive .

1077
01:28:13,538 --> 01:28:17,009
- My God ! Oh , my God ! - What is it ?

1078
01:28:17,877 --> 01:28:19,913
The doctor won 't proceed with the operation ...

1079
01:28:20,012 --> 01:28:22,618
without available blood for Billy .

1080
01:28:23,149 --> 01:28:25,628
Billy 's blood type is rare .

1081
01:28:27,420 --> 01:28:30,060
- Doctor , what 's Billy 's blood type ? - AB .

1082
01:28:32,225 --> 01:28:33,898
I 'm type AB .

1083
01:29:16,601 --> 01:29:18,774
Take it easy .

1084
01:29:18,938 --> 01:29:22,248
You lost a lot of blood .

1085
01:29:23,275 --> 01:29:24,253
Hello .

1086
01:29:24,877 --> 01:29:30,953
Thelma , I couldn 't refuse . The boy 's life was at stake .

1087
01:29:31,083 --> 01:29:34,725
Then I saw lnton . He 's next ! My God !

1088
01:29:34,820 --> 01:29:37,994
I have to go to him . I have to help him .

1089
01:29:38,091 --> 01:29:40,970
You 're forgetting he doesn 't want to see you .

1090
01:29:41,627 --> 01:29:43,265
He might misinterpret .

1091
01:29:43,962 --> 01:29:44,940
Hello ?

1092
01:29:45,832 --> 01:29:47,640
Aunt , was that Mommy ?

1093
01:29:49,969 --> 01:29:52,279
Yes , that was your Mommy .

1094
01:29:52,372 --> 01:29:54,476
How is Billy ?

1095
01:29:55,375 --> 01:30:00,154
Your Mommy said don 't worry , your friend is okay .

1096
01:30:05,251 --> 01:30:11,327
Sir , Mrs. Joy Ramirez is here . She said it 's about your kids .

1097
01:30:11,923 --> 01:30:12,925
Okay , just a minute .

1098
01:30:13,592 --> 01:30:15,265
Don 't tell her I 'm here .

1099
01:30:15,795 --> 01:30:16,899
I 'll call back .

1100
01:30:18,463 --> 01:30:19,442
Is it Louie ?

1101
01:30:20,265 --> 01:30:21,539
It 's Joy . She 's in the lobby .

1102
01:30:24,537 --> 01:30:26,516
She wants to talk about the kids .

1103
01:30:28,673 --> 01:30:29,948
Don 't trust her .

1104
01:30:30,877 --> 01:30:32,948
Sometimes she scares me too .

1105
01:30:37,149 --> 01:30:39,528
Ma 'am , lobby phone .

1106
01:30:44,823 --> 01:30:46,201
Hello ! lnton !

1107
01:30:46,292 --> 01:30:48,203
So you took the children from mother .

1108
01:30:48,493 --> 01:30:49,631
You hid them .

1109
01:30:50,095 --> 01:30:52,076
That 's kidnapping .

1110
01:30:52,364 --> 01:30:54,537
That 's not why I came .

1111
01:30:54,699 --> 01:30:57,078
Please listen to me first .

1112
01:30:57,170 --> 01:30:58,944
I went to the house this afternoon .

1113
01:30:59,704 --> 01:31:01,582
Your things were gone .

1114
01:31:02,307 --> 01:31:04,810
I went to make sure the children are safe .

1115
01:31:04,911 --> 01:31:08,791
Lnton , the children are safe . Why will I endanger them ?

1116
01:31:08,881 --> 01:31:09,859
Look .

1117
01:31:11,283 --> 01:31:13,354
Tell me where they are .

1118
01:31:14,319 --> 01:31:18,268
And like I promised , we 'll talk calmly .

1119
01:31:19,257 --> 01:31:22,204
When you came , we were just at Teodoro 's .

1120
01:31:22,462 --> 01:31:25,533
The kids are with Thelma now .

1121
01:31:25,864 --> 01:31:27,037
Is that true , Joy ?

1122
01:31:27,466 --> 01:31:32,849
Lnton , where else will I take them ? You know I have no family in Manila .

1123
01:31:32,939 --> 01:31:34,850
Okay , I believe you .

1124
01:31:34,940 --> 01:31:39,219
We 'll ask the guard to let you up so we can talk .

1125
01:31:39,612 --> 01:31:42,717
I don 't want the children involved in this mess .

1126
01:31:42,881 --> 01:31:45,521
I don 't want them to carry this trauma when they grow up .

1127
01:31:59,164 --> 01:32:00,143
Reception .

1128
01:32:01,766 --> 01:32:02,744
Yes , Sir .

1129
01:32:04,170 --> 01:32:07,150
Ma 'am , you may go up to Room 1404 .

1130
01:32:14,046 --> 01:32:15,024
Thelma .

1131
01:32:16,282 --> 01:32:19,456
Inton already agreed to talk personally .

1132
01:32:22,255 --> 01:32:23,563
I don 't know .

1133
01:32:24,055 --> 01:32:28,765
I told him where the kids are . You should leave .

1134
