1151
01:34:01,953 --> 01:34:03,661
I can save you if ...

1152
01:34:04,122 --> 01:34:05,158
lnton !

1153
01:34:10,630 --> 01:34:12,006
Inton , please !

1154
01:34:12,430 --> 01:34:16,378
After the ticket office , I 'll check in for us and the kids .

1155
01:34:16,435 --> 01:34:18,881
Your mother can pick up her ticket at 8 : 00 am .

1156
01:34:18,970 --> 01:34:20,847
