1157
01:34:23,175 --> 01:34:24,153
Dina !

1158
01:34:27,912 --> 01:34:28,948
Louie ?

1159
01:34:48,501 --> 01:34:50,173
Inton !

1160
01:34:50,269 --> 01:34:52,010
Inton ...

1161
01:34:55,875 --> 01:35:00,186
- I have no sin against you ! - Why did you come here ?

1162
01:35:02,414 --> 01:35:03,416
Louie ?

1163
01:35:03,882 --> 01:35:05,920
You 're Louie !

1164
01:35:07,819 --> 01:35:09,060
You 're lnton 's wife ?

1165
01:35:09,622 --> 01:35:10,600
What ?

1166
01:35:10,689 --> 01:35:11,895
You 're Joy ?

1167
01:35:12,291 --> 01:35:13,326
Yes , it 's me !

1168
01:35:13,492 --> 01:35:15,301
I 'm lnton 's wife .

1169
01:35:16,395 --> 01:35:17,372
Then ...

1170
01:35:19,230 --> 01:35:21,108
you understand me , don 't you ?

1171
01:35:21,701 --> 01:35:22,735
- Louie , please ? - Right ?

1172
01:35:22,935 --> 01:35:24,811
Do you understand me ?

1173
01:35:24,970 --> 01:35:26,414
Yes , I understand you !

1174
01:35:26,505 --> 01:35:30,350
They both betrayed us . Louie , please don 't !

1175
01:35:31,711 --> 01:35:32,814
- Please ... - You know ...

1176
01:35:34,447 --> 01:35:36,756
there 's just one bullet left .

1177
01:35:40,386 --> 01:35:42,764
- I 'm glad I got to know you . - Louie ...

1178
01:35:43,588 --> 01:35:46,262
We can still fix this .

1179
01:35:47,126 --> 01:35:48,365
You 're so lucky .

1180
01:35:55,266 --> 01:35:56,244
Hello ?

1181
01:35:57,136 --> 01:35:59,309
Thelma , lnton is gone .

1182
01:36:00,139 --> 01:36:02,448
Aunt , is that Mommy ?

1183
01:36:03,676 --> 01:36:04,654
Yes , Ingrid .

1184
01:36:04,909 --> 01:36:07,322
Ingrid is playing . Denton is sleeping .

1185
01:36:08,213 --> 01:36:10,716
What happened , Joy ?

1186
01:36:12,484 --> 01:36:15,728
Louie , Dina 's husband ...

1187
01:36:16,354 --> 01:36:18,994
He shot them , then shot himself .

1188
01:36:19,091 --> 01:36:20,126
My God !

1189
01:36:20,893 --> 01:36:23,463
Where will I take the kids now ?

1190
01:36:24,529 --> 01:36:26,372
I still have to stay here for a while .

1191
01:36:26,631 --> 01:36:29,636
It might be better if you take them back home .

1192
01:36:30,703 --> 01:36:33,182
Okay , Joy . My phone 's battery 's running out .

1193
01:36:34,105 --> 01:36:35,083
Hello ?

1194
01:36:36,242 --> 01:36:37,380
Hello , Thelma ?

1195
01:36:50,588 --> 01:36:53,592
Ingrid , when is your birthday ?

1196
01:36:53,658 --> 01:36:56,435
July 10,1991 .

1197
01:37:00,733 --> 01:37:01,939
Year of the rooster .

1198
