What about your brother ?

1199
01:37:06,471 --> 01:37:09,453
September 6 , 1993 .

1200
01:37:09,542 --> 01:37:11,613
Why , Aunt Thelma ?

1201
01:37:14,814 --> 01:37:16,087
We 're the same .

1202
01:37:18,951 --> 01:37:20,328
What a slow vehicle .

1203
01:37:39,771 --> 01:37:41,011
Thank you .

1204
01:37:46,011 --> 01:37:47,752
Good morning , Mrs. Ramirez .

1205
01:37:48,713 --> 01:37:52,662
I 'm Atty . Regalado . Lawyer of Mrs. Lily Mendoza .

1206
01:37:52,751 --> 01:37:54,229
What do you want ?

1207
01:37:54,520 --> 01:37:56,658
Please excuse my dropping by like this .

1208
01:37:57,189 --> 01:37:59,896
Your place was hard to find .

1209
01:38:00,192 --> 01:38:05,835
Mrs. Lily Mendoza wants you to consider her offer .

1210
01:38:06,564 --> 01:38:12,105
She 'll give you 5 million cash for the mirror she wants .

1211
01:38:14,372 --> 01:38:16,546
You look surprised .

1212
01:38:16,809 --> 01:38:20,256
Even I will be surprised if I get an instant 5 million .

1213
01:38:20,378 --> 01:38:21,118
No .

1214
01:38:22,081 --> 01:38:25,756
- Ma 'am , I thought ... - I refuse your offer , Attorney .

1215
01:38:27,286 --> 01:38:30,198
I 'll raise the offer to 10 million .

1216
01:38:32,358 --> 01:38:33,802
Cash ! Right now !

1217
01:38:37,363 --> 01:38:39,809
Even if you double it ...

1218
01:38:40,832 --> 01:38:42,278
I will refuse .

1219
01:38:42,967 --> 01:38:46,414
I know it 's hard to understand , but I have to do it .

1220
01:38:47,305 --> 01:38:48,841
I 'm sorry , Attorney .

1221
01:38:49,440 --> 01:38:50,783
Please leave .

1222
01:39:08,460 --> 01:39:10,804
I regret I got you .

1223
01:39:12,597 --> 01:39:15,670
I regret that I ever believed in luck .

1224
01:39:17,603 --> 01:39:19,514
You took so many lives .

1225
01:39:22,942 --> 01:39:25,149
You took so many lives !

1226
01:40:04,649 --> 01:40:06,890
- Mommy ! - Mommy !

1227
01:40:07,286 --> 01:40:08,264
Kids !

1228
01:40:12,224 --> 01:40:13,896
I was so worried about you .

1229
01:40:14,126 --> 01:40:15,537
What happened to you ?

1230
01:40:15,961 --> 01:40:18,600
Mommy , there was a big accident in the highway .

1231
01:40:18,896 --> 01:40:20,967
So many vehicles were in the accident .

1232
01:40:21,300 --> 01:40:23,871
It 's a good thing Aunt Thelma drives well .

1233
01:40:24,103 --> 01:40:27,243
So many died , even animals !

1234
01:40:28,106 --> 01:40:29,551
Shhh ... Stop it .

1235
01:40:30,676 --> 01:40:31,881
You 're here now .

1236
01:40:32,411 --> 01:40:33,412
We 're here now .

1237
01:40:34,313 --> 01:40:35,757
No more to frighten us .

1238
01:40:36,715 --> 01:40:37,886
No more ghosts .

1239
01:40:38,649 --> 01:40:41,893
Most of all , we 're all together now .

1240
01:40:42,488 --> 01:40:45,400
Is Daddy home yet ?

1241
01:40:55,634 --> 01:40:56,305
Not yet .

1242
01:40:59,404 --> 01:41:00,610
You 're so dirty .

1243
01:41:03,042 --> 01:41:05,113
Better wash up first .

1244
01:41:06,612 --> 01:41:07,818
Go change your clothes .

1245
01:41:17,722 --> 01:41:19,065
Thanks , Thelma .

1246
01:41:20,926 --> 01:41:22,529
I owe you a lot .

1247
01:41:25,163 --> 01:41:25,868
No problem .

1248
01:41:29,568 --> 01:41:32,344
Come , I 'll show you something .

1249
01:41:45,850 --> 01:41:46,828
You broke it ?

1250
01:41:48,087 --> 01:41:50,761
Earlier , a lawyer was waiting for me .

1251
01:41:51,457 --> 01:41:54,063
He offered 10 million pesos for the Bagua .

1252
01:41:54,960 --> 01:41:55,994
I refused .

1253
01:41:57,429 --> 01:41:59,568
Then , I did what Mr. Liao said .

1254
01:42:00,064 --> 01:42:00,940
I broke it .

1255
01:42:02,134 --> 01:42:03,408
What 's important is it 's over .

1256
01:42:07,672 --> 01:42:09,243
I only have one problem left .

1257
01:42:10,375 --> 01:42:13,355
How will I tell the children what happened to their Daddy ?

1258
01:42:14,011 --> 01:42:16,423
They already know . Believe me .

1259
01:42:17,483 --> 01:42:21,363
My only problem now is how to tell you .

1260
01:42:23,488 --> 01:42:24,762
What will you tell me ?

1261
01:42:25,157 --> 01:42:26,430
Did you tell her already ?

1262
01:42:27,126 --> 01:42:29,970
Almost , but you interrupted .

1263
01:42:30,628 --> 01:42:31,403
Now you tell her .

1264
01:42:33,297 --> 01:42:34,777
Thelma ... I don 't like

1265
01:42:35,533 --> 01:42:36,534
Listen to your son .

1266
01:42:36,969 --> 01:42:38,811
Mommy , we have a surprise for you .

1267
01:42:40,005 --> 01:42:41,279
Ingrid , come out !

1268
01:42:54,685 --> 01:42:56,722
We were in the accident , Joy .

1269
01:43:01,059 --> 01:43:02,868
We 're among those who died .

1270
01:43:38,162 --> 01:43:38,731
Bro ...

1271
01:43:43,668 --> 01:43:45,409
Come in .

1272
01:43:45,770 --> 01:43:47,444
That goes there , by the kitchen .

1273
01:43:48,573 --> 01:43:51,247
That goes upstairs .

1274
01:43:52,911 --> 01:43:55,448
You threw the ball too hard !

1275
01:43:55,546 --> 01:43:59,323
Let 's both get it ! Quick !

1276
01:44:04,957 --> 01:44:06,435
What 's that ?

1277
01:44:06,591 --> 01:44:07,797
It 's a toy .

1278
01:44:08,193 --> 01:44:10,069
Come on , let 's show it to Mommy .

1279
01:44:13,765 --> 01:44:16,904
Mommy ... Mommy !

